{"title":"Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003eA Tree For Every Home and Style\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAt King of Christmas, our artificial Christmas trees are designed to be the centerpiece of your holiday home. Crafted with lifelike foliage, durable construction, and effortless setup, each tree is made so you can enjoy the magic of the season year after year. Whether you are looking for a \u003ca title=\"Full Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/full-artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003efull traditional tree\u003c\/a\u003e, \u003ca title=\"Slim Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/slim-artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003eslim space-saving design\u003c\/a\u003e, or a \u003ca title=\"Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/pre-lit-artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003epre-lit artificial Christmas tree\u003c\/a\u003e, our collection includes a variety of styles, sizes and lighting options to fit every home. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our collection of artificial Christmas trees and discover why thousands of customers choose King of Christmas for their holiday traditions. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 style=\"text-align: left;\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy choose an artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eArtificial Christmas trees, also referred to as fake Christmas trees or faux Christmas trees, have become the preferred choice for many, thanks to their convenience, longevity and realistic appearance. Today's \u003ca title=\"Premium Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/premium-trees\"\u003emost realistic artificial Christmas trees\u003c\/a\u003e closely resemble natural and real evergreen Christmas trees.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eHere are some reasons why Christmas enthusiasts are picking artificial Christmas trees over real: \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eConvenience and Lasting Traditions: Artificial Christmas trees eliminate the mess and maintenance of a real tree. King of Christmas trees feature easy setup systems and hinged branches, allowing you to assemble your tree in minutes. No more sap, bugs, or fallen needles to clean up! Best of all, you can enjoy the same beautiful tree for years to come, creating lasting holiday memories with your loved ones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003ePeace of Mind During the Holidays: Our pre-lit trees feature professionally installed lighting, creating a beautiful and reliable holiday centerpiece you can enjoy with confidence all season long. Whether you are looking for a classic warm white glow, or a vibrant multicolor display, our faux Christmas trees with lights make it effortless to create the perfect holiday atmosphere - no tangled cords, no complicated setup. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA Tree for Every Home: With artificial Christmas trees from King of Christmas, you can choose from a wide range of styles, sizes, and lighting options designed to suit any home. From full traditional trees to slim space-saving designs and beautifully flocked Christmas tree styles, our collection makes it easy to find the perfect tree. No matter where you live, you can enjoy the look of a stunning evergreen or flocked tree that fits your home and holiday style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"p1\"\u003eWhat is the most realistic artificial Christmas Tree?\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eToday’s artificial Christmas trees are designed to mimic the real thing. King of Christmas \u003ca title=\"Premium Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/premium-trees\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003epremium artificial trees\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e are crafted to be our most realistic tree options, featuring carefully crafted branch tips and ultra-lifelike foliage that replicate the look and texture of real trees, creating a stunning centerpiece for your holiday décor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe \u003ca title=\"King Fraser Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/king-fraser-fir-trees\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eKing Fraser Fir\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e is one of our most popular and realistic Christmas trees that closely resembles the gorgeous Fraser Fir. Designed with careful attention to detail, the King Fraser Fir captures the timeless beauty of a natural Fraser Fir. Its lush foliage and classic conical shape create a full, realistic silhouette that brings the look of a freshly cut tree into your home. Available in a variety of sizes, as well as full or slim, the King Fraser Fir makes it easy to find the perfect centerpiece for your holiday décor. The King Fraser Fir is often considered one of the best artificial Christmas trees for those seeking a highly realistic, full-bodied silhouette.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eOther evergreen options include the \u003ca title=\"Aspen Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/aspen-fir-trees\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eAspen Fir\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca title=\"Cypress Spruce Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/cypress-spruce-trees\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eCypress Spruce\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e. Customers often note that these artificial Christmas trees are difficult to distinguish from their real counterparts, thanks to their carefully crafted branch structure, rich color, and lifelike fullness. Explore our most realistic artificial Christmas trees to find a design that closely mimics the look of the natural evergreen you prefer. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"p1\"\u003eRealistic vs. Classic Artificial Christmas Trees: What’s the Difference?\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003ca title=\"Classic Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/classic-trees\"\u003eClassic artificial Christmas trees\u003c\/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/classic-trees\"\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e are a wonderful choice for those seeking a beautiful holiday centerpiece at a more accessible price point. With full, lush branch coverage and a timeless silhouette, classic trees are perfect for decorating with ornaments, ribbon, and garland. Made from 100% PVC, classic trees offer the nostalgic charm many families have known and loved for generations. They're also a smart pick for secondary spaces like offices, guest rooms, or additional displays throughout your home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003ca title=\"Realistic Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/realistic-trees\"\u003eRealistic artificial Christmas trees\u003c\/a\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/realistic-trees\"\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e take things a step further, with advanced foliage engineered to closely mimic the look and texture of a natural evergreen, right down to the color variation, branch structure, and three-dimensional needle detail. Crafted using a blend of PE and PVC, these trees feature PE tips, a molded material that replicates the look and feel of real branches with exceptional accuracy. These trees are ideal for those who want a centerpiece that is difficult to distinguish from a real tree. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eBoth styles offer the same convenience, durability, and easy setup that make artificial trees a holiday favorite. The choice really comes down to your priorities: timeless style and value, or a tree that really keeps the guests guessing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"p1\"\u003eWhat should I consider when buying an artificial Christmas tree? \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eChoosing the right artificial Christmas tree depends on several factors, including realism preference, lighting options, size, and price. Consider the height of your ceiling, the shape of the tree, and whether you prefer a pre-lit or unlit design. A well-selected tree brings lasting beauty to your holiday celebrations year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"p1\"\u003eWhich King of Christmas tree is the best for my home? \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eWhether you’re looking for a slim, space-saving tree or a bold, full silhouette, King of Christmas offers a variety of artificial Christmas tree styles to fit any home. Our collection includes different shapes, sizes, and lighting options, including pre-lit trees with multi-color or twinkling light functions, as well as top-rated flocked Christmas trees that offer the look of freshly fallen snow. To help you find the perfect tree for your space and decorating style, try our \u003ca title=\"Find The Perfect Christmas Tree\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/a\/p\/find-the-perfect-christmas-tree?instore=true#\/\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eTree Quiz\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e to discover which option best fits your holiday vision.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"p1\"\u003eWhat size Christmas tree should I buy?\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eWe recommend leaving at least 6 inches to a foot of space from the top tip of the tree to the ceiling. This allows you to leave room for a tree topper, and overall offers a better presence in your space. To learn more about selecting the right size tree for your home, explore our \u003ca title=\"Artificial Christmas Tree Buyers Guide\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/pages\/buyers-guide\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eTree Buying Guide\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"p1\"\u003eWhy choose a King of Christmas artificial Christmas tree? \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eKing of Christmas artificial Christmas trees are designed to combine realistic beauty, durability, and convenience. Our trees feature lifelike branch tips, full silhouettes, and high-quality materials. We also offer beautifully flocked options that recreate the look of freshly fallen snow.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eEach tree also includes complimentary shaping gloves to make fluffing the branches easy and an after-season storage bag for convenient storage after the holidays. Known for offering premium designs at a more accessible price point, King of Christmas makes it easy to enjoy a stunning holiday centerpiece year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eEvery King of Christmas tree ships free right to your door anywhere in the contiguous USA. Plus, with our 2-year warranty, you can shop with confidence and look forward to many seasons of holiday magic. \u003cem\u003eExclusions apply - final sale and clearance items are covered by a 90-day warranty.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"p1\"\u003eWhat is the best artificial Christmas tree?\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe best artificial Christmas tree depends on your preference for realism, size, and lighting, but many customers consider highly realistic PE trees such as Fraser Fir styles to be the best option for their lifelike appearance. For added convenience, \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/pre-lit-artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003epre-lit artificial Christmas trees\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e are also a popular choice, offering professionally installed lighting and easy setup.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"p1\"\u003eWhat is the difference between PE and PVC Christmas trees?\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003ePE (polyethylene) trees are designed to mimic real branches for a more realistic appearance, while PVC trees use traditional flat needles to create a fuller, more classic look.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eWhether you're searching for the most realistic artificial Christmas tree or a convenient pre-lit option, King of Christmas offers thoughtfully designed trees to suit every home. Explore our collection to find a tree that brings lasting beauty, ease, and holiday tradition into your space year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-unlit","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642895167552,"sku":"PF-T8-U","price":219.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-11_5e399119-a4fe-4d26-8c77-bde58886c97f.jpg?v=1718158952"},{"product_id":"6-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"6' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 350 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642895921216,"sku":"PF-T6-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fbb2edf4-c5c9-4ad1-b201-ca0c1c1c4b0e.jpg?v=1714675465"},{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41965569769672,"sku":"PF-T7-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fa622227-8cc4-441c-b46e-a6f7c09044bd.jpg?v=1714675463"},{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896379968,"sku":"PF-T8-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d.jpg?v=1714675448"},{"product_id":"10-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896707648,"sku":"PF-T10-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d_1.jpg?v=1761241980"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642896805952,"sku":"QF-T6.5-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/